00:26:04.690 --> 00:26:06.720
can modernizing and
modernize their gaming

00:26:06.720 --> 00:26:09.390
applications with Spanner.

00:26:09.390 --> 00:26:12.995
Again to benefit from the
scale and consistency which

00:26:12.995 --> 00:26:14.260
Spanner offers.

00:26:14.260 --> 00:26:16.470
There's also a showcase
demo which has been planned,

00:26:16.470 --> 00:26:18.120
and there's a quick lab.

00:26:18.120 --> 00:26:23.360
We welcome you to try it out
and learn more about Spanner

00:26:23.360 --> 00:26:24.710
through that.

00:26:24.710 --> 00:26:26.850
With that, thanks a lot.

00:26:26.850 --> 00:26:29.260
Thanks for your
time and attention.

00:26:29.260 --> 00:26:31.030
